# Refusal retry (caps 1-3): the train ground truth never expects "I can not answer." in caps 1-3, and our
# train refusals were 5% right. A give-up is re-asked: after tool data -> "extract the value from the
# results" (2 rounds); with no tool call at all -> "call a relevant tool first" (2 rounds).
M3_ADAPTER_REFUSAL_RECOVERY_ROUNDS=2
M3_ADAPTER_REQUIRE_TOOL_ROUNDS=2
M3_ADAPTER_RETRY_UNATTEMPTED_REFUSAL=true
